      "content": "\"let the silence take over\"... that's exactly it. that's the only thing that sounds peaceful. everyone keeps saying \"it gets better\" or \"time heals,\" but they don't get that there's nothing left to heal. it's like the world has already finished with me. if i'm already a ghost, why am i still forced to keep dealing with the noise? i just want it to be quiet. permanent quiet.",
